  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:shema_qolenu">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/1"/>Hear our voice, Adonoy, our God;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/2"/>spare us and have compassion on us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/3"/>and accept
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/4"/>our prayers mercifully and willingly.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:lamentations/5/21"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/5"/>Lead us back to You, Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/6"/>and we shall find the way back;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/7"/>renew our days as of old.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/51/13"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/8"/>Cast us not away from Your Presence,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/9"/>and Your holy spirit take not from us.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/10"/>Do not cast us off in time of old age,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/11"/>when our strength fails, do not forsake us.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/12"/>Forsake us not, Adonoy, our God
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/13"/>be not far removed from us.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/14"/>Give us a sign of Your goodness
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/15"/>that our enemies may see it and be ashamed;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/16"/>for You, Adonoy, have helped us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shema_qolenu/17"/>and comforted us.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
